/th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$5.5/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$8/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$12/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Sandstone</b> is one of the many rock nodes that spawn around Oakland. These nodes are found on the sandy shores of the island and the large desert across the bridge.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ore\">Ore</span></h2>\n<p>The chart below displays all possible ore that spawn within this node.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a7/Sand.png/revision/latest?cb=20230117003918\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sand\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"93\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Sand.png\" data-image-key=\"Sand.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a7/Sand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230117003918\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sand\" title=\"Sand\">Sand</a>\n</td>\n<td>Sand spawns <b>exclusively</b> in Sandstone nodes.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"2887e69ba44b044dc4bac098dca7bfdc\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Sandstone_Map-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Sandstone_Map.png\" title=\"Sandstone Map.png (702 KB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/91/Sandstone_Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230823044144\" title=\"Sandstone Map.png (702 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Location on the Map\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Sandstone Map.png\" data-image-key=\"S